OL,3,GNEWSAMan who died in M6 crash
OL,4,A'remembered with love'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who died in a four-vehicle crash
OL,7,Fon the M6 was "a devoted and loving
OL,8,Fhusband" and "a loyal friend", his
OL,9,Ffamily has said.
OL,11,FDonald Sheppard, 64, from Birmingham,
OL,12,Fwas driving a Ford Focus when he was
OL,13,Finvolved in a crash with three lorries
OL,14,Fat 04:10 BST on Monday. He died at the
OL,15,Fscene.
OL,17,FIt happened on the northbound
OL,18,Fcarriageway of the motorway, between
OL,19,Fjunctions 15 and 16, close to Seabridge
OL,20,Fin Newcastle-under-Lyme, Staffordshire.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
