OL,3,GNEWSAMan who died in M6 crash
OL,4,A'remembered with love'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"He touched the lives of countless
OL,7,Fpeople through his kindness, warmth,
OL,8,Fand willingness to help others," his
OL,9,Ffamily said in statement on Thursday.
